            },
            {
              "text": " Beyond Books Qld is a cloud based bookkeeping practice owned and run by Melissa Plant in Toowoomba. Melissa is a registered BAS Agent, holds membership to the Institute of Certified Bookkeepers & Australian Bookkeepers Network, and is a certified Xero Partner and QBO Pro Adviser."
            }
